Chrome Extension banana web development ka ek alag jungle hai.
Yaha HTML + CSS + JS to chalta hi hai,
but
browser APIs,
permissions,
manifest system,
background workers
— ye sab bhi samajhna padta hai.

Chrome Extension ka Basic Architectur
Har Chrome extension me mostly ye cheeze hoti hain:
1. manifest.json =Extension ka brain/configuration
2. popup.html = UI jo extension icon click par khulta hai
3. popup.js = Popup ka logic
4. background.js / service-worker.js = Background tasks
5. content.js = Website ke andar JS inject karna
6. icons/ = Extension icons

